{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Scifi Racing Team",
    "steam_appid": 3026180,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EMBARK ON YOUR OWN JOURNEY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your own team and go from championship to championship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the eye of a supplier and become a factory team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your team by developing your headquarters, hiring talented drivers and designers and getting better sponsor deals.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire the best designers right away or try to develop their skills over the seasons.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own parts or get them from a supplier.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tradeoffs will see you succeed or fail over the course of a season.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch long-term projects to achieve a leap in performance.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADAPT TO REGULATION CHANGES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start working on the next generation race pod in advance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure the deal you make with a supplier will not bite you in the back upon a new regulation change a few seasons later.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEVELOP YOUR OWN DRIVER ACADEMY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let new drivers gain experience in lower championships and then promote them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INVEST IN INFRASTRUCTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your headquarters for better R&amp;D, performance and weather forecasting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOCUS ON YOUR TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is more about developping your team than managing races. You will have the opportunity to adjust some strategy elements before a race but you will not micromanage it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BOTS PLAY BY THE RULES</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EMBARK ON YOUR OWN JOURNEY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your own team and go from championship to championship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the eye of a supplier and become a factory team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your team by developing your headquarters, hiring talented drivers and designers and getting better sponsor deals.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire the best designers right away or try to develop their skills over the seasons.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own parts or get them from a supplier.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tradeoffs will see you succeed or fail over the course of a season.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch long-term projects to achieve a leap in performance.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADAPT TO REGULATION CHANGES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start working on the next generation race pod in advance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure the deal you make with a supplier will not bite you in the back upon a new regulation change a few seasons later.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEVELOP YOUR OWN DRIVER ACADEMY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let new drivers gain experience in lower championships and then promote them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INVEST IN INFRASTRUCTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your headquarters for better R&amp;D, performance and weather forecasting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOCUS ON YOUR TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is more about developping your team than managing races. You will have the opportunity to adjust some strategy elements before a race but you will not micromanage it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BOTS PLAY BY THE RULES</strong></h2>",
    "short_description": "A racing team manager that throws micromanagement out of the window. Lead your team to victory in various championships while adapting to new challenges over the seasons. Also, bots don't cheat.",
